WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.480
Now that we've talked a bit about computed observables,

00:00:03.480 --> 00:00:06.450
for which of these examples would we likely use one?

00:00:06.450 --> 00:00:08.100
A list of cats,

00:00:08.100 --> 00:00:11.340
the full name for a cat based on the first and last,

00:00:11.340 --> 00:00:12.945
the number of clicks for a cat,

00:00:12.945 --> 00:00:14.625
the image URL for a cat,

00:00:14.625 --> 00:00:17.580
or the cat's title based on the number of clicks.

00:00:17.580 --> 00:00:22.620
There are between zero and five correct answers, inclusive

